{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/42f9b1ce9e39bbd2792071dc78a7401b.avif?t=1755697009\" width=184 height=150 /></span>In DARKWORLD, you\u2019re a snailf et you live in a forge a bit odd\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work, as an assistant, is to clean the rare and mysterious weapons brought by some fierce adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some come from far away, so, don\u2019t make them wait too much! Use all your different tools (brushes, hammer, anti-rust), organize yourself freely and MAKE IT SHINE!!! Bit by bit, as they go by, you\u2019ll be able to learn more about DARKWORLD\u2019s curse and its legends\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY YOU'LL LOVE THIS GAME?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cosy atmosphere, without any enemy nor violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large range of cleaning tools and different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Appealing characters &amp; rich storylines, created by the famous comic book artist Valentin Seiche (The World, Samurai Gunn:Trigger Soul)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Very satisfying feedbacks when cleaning each layer on weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of cuteness &amp; humor and really lovely animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Some SURPRISES !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick you hammer and crash some rocks to free weapons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before cleaning them\u2026 Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because, it\u2019s fun ! And if you're lucky, you'll find some gems among all the weeds ans scraps...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fcd8e5d0ab0b69188ccc4d0439082d1f.poster.avif?t=1755697009\" width=512 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fcd8e5d0ab0b69188ccc4d0439082d1f.webm?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fcd8e5d0ab0b69188ccc4d0439082d1f.mp4?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean your client\u2019s weapon with your pencils or brushes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of the pencils available and clean the dust on weapons :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some brushes are heavier and slow but more powerful or/and with a better range,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other ones are lighter so quicker to use but less efficient\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/d3650d55186c40611fb8dd5bbfc8d314.poster.avif?t=1755697009\" width=800 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/d3650d55186c40611fb8dd5bbfc8d314.webm?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/d3650d55186c40611fb8dd5bbfc8d314.mp4?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have to remove the rust with a large variety of tools...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LISTEN TO CLIENTS TO DISCOVER AMAZING STORIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blacksmith will get a lots of clients\u2019 visits : these badass characters will bring you a weapon related to amazing tales and legends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen and discover more about the lore of Darkworld and unlock some of its secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fd22e33780b317211a8051cc381b190b.poster.avif?t=1755697009\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fd22e33780b317211a8051cc381b190b.webm?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/extras/fd22e33780b317211a8051cc381b190b.mp4?t=1755697009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tiny house for your snailf to sleep in : decoration, skins for your snailf, bed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Minions unlock through secrets : they can help you to clean and do other stuff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Day/Night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mini-games and other suprises...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Amazing music by Anton Corazza (TMNT: Shredder's Revenge, Demon Turf, Super Catboy...)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2601150?t=1755697009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2601150?t=1755697009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601150/caps